  ('p', "The right order: first the SBC that ends tonight, using your duplicates of the required rating. Then the first challenge of the set, checking that the other two are still possible with what you have left. Finally the Re-roll, with the duplicates that weren't used anywhere else. The expensive tradeable cards stay aside: they are worth more on the market."),
