  ('p', "On the SBC page, the tiles are sorted from best to worst value. Each tile shows the estimated gain or loss for your club: “Good value +3,928”, “Not worth it −1,338”… When the value of a reward isn't known, you can enter it yourself in the SBC screen and the ranking updates."),
